(Apna Din) Tj
T* (Scaler x Wispr Flow  |  Build for Bharat  |  Round 2) Tj
T* (Theme: Livelihoods and small business) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (A domestic worker speaks her day at home. The app repeats the) Tj
T* (numbers. She confirms. The month stays on her phone.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The main task is speaking, not filling a wage form. There is no) Tj
T* (login. The app starts with no API key.) Tj
ET
endstream
