(1. Problem and solution) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Who has the problem) Tj
T* (A woman doing paid housework in Maharashtra, usually in more than) Tj
T* (one home, paid in cash in the first week of the next month.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Youth for Unity and Voluntary Action, with the Maharashtra domestic) Tj
T* (worker network MRGKSS, surveyed 5,019 workers in 15 districts in) Tj
T* (February and March 2024.) Tj
T* (- 99.6 percent were women.) Tj
T* (- 1.0 percent had a written contract \(50 of 5,019\).) Tj
T* (- 98.5 percent were paid in cash.) Tj
T* (- 73.5 percent were paid in the first week of the next month.) Tj
T* (- 27.3 percent said wages were cut for every holiday.) Tj
T* (- 18.1 percent said the employer deducts for a broken household item.) Tj
T* (Source: Situational Analysis of Domestic Workers in 15 Districts of) Tj
T* (Maharashtra, YUVA, 2025. Tables 2.6, 2.38, 2.44, 2.45, 2.54, 2.55.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Section 50\(4\) of the Code on Wages, 2019 says a household employing) Tj
T* (not more than five people for domestic work does not have to issue) Tj
T* (a wage slip. The Code came into force on 21 November 2025.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (What the survey does not show: how often her own count of days) Tj
T* (differs from the cash in her hand. The case stories in that report) Tj
T* (are about dismissal, which this app does not fix.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (How the product answers the part it can) Tj
T* (In the evening, in her own house, she says one sentence:) Tj
T* (who the house was, whether she went, and any cut, advance, or cash.) Tj
T* (Apna Din reads that back in Hindi. Nothing is stored until she) Tj
T* (says it is right. The month card is days, cuts, advances, and cash) Tj
T* (she confirmed. She can listen to it or copy the text.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (It does not pay her, message the employer, or file a labour case.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
