(2. Who it is for) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The person at the microphone is the worker, not the employer.) Tj
T* (Employer apps already exist \(Helper, DailyPlus, Pratyek, Ooru\).) Tj
T* (They need the employer to mark the day or sign. Apna Din is the) Tj
T* (note she can make when the employer will not.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (How many) Tj
T* (The counted group we will actually use is small.) Tj
T* (- 5,019 workers in the 2024 Maharashtra survey. That is a sample,) Tj
T* (  recruited with unions, not a census.) Tj
T* (- MRGKSS, the network that fielded the survey, has 32 member) Tj
T* (  organisations. That is the realistic door.) Tj
T* (- The survey does not say how many of them have their own phone.) Tj
T* (  A shared family phone can expose her cash. That is an open risk.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (First users: 10 women in one collective, in Pune or Mumbai, for) Tj
T* (one month. Not a national market. We will not multiply 5,019 into) Tj
T* (a crore of users.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (A judge should treat 27.3 percent as a deduction policy in this) Tj
T* (sample, not as proof that employers miscount days.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
5 0 obj
<< /Length 1375 >>
stream
BT
/F1 12 Tf
50 780 Td
