(3. What it depends on) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Voice in) Tj
T* (The browser Speech Recognition API, language hi-IN, in Chrome or) Tj
T* (Edge. We do not hold an OpenAI, Google, Sarvam, or Wispr key.) Tj
T* (Chrome may send that audio to its own speech service. Our server) Tj
T* (never receives the recording. If recognition is missing, or the) Tj
T* (mic is blocked, she types the same sentence. The card still saves.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Voice out) Tj
T* (The browser speechSynthesis voice, language hi-IN, speaks the) Tj
T* (read-back and the month card. If that voice is unavailable, the) Tj
T* (same words stay on screen.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The part that must not break) Tj
T* (Numbers are read by our own code: do sau is 200, dedh sau is 150,) Tj
T* (saade teen hazaar is 3,500, chhabbees din is 26 days. A cut is not) Tj
T* (stored as pay. A month she states in one sentence is not counted) Tj
T* (as a single day. Tests cover these cases. No model decides the) Tj
T* (rupees.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (If a speech service becomes paid or shuts) Tj
T* (The typed sentence, the parser, the card, and the copy button keep) Tj
T* (working. There is no bill to us, because there is no key.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Data) Tj
T* (Confirmed lines stay in the browser on that phone. Docker only) Tj
T* (serves the page. Restarting the container does not delete her card.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
