(4. Launch plan) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (We do not start on an app store.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Week 1. Sit with one organiser from a Pune or Mumbai member of) Tj
T* (MRGKSS. Show the flow on one phone. Ask whether the sentence) Tj
T* (matches how their members already talk.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Weeks 2 to 5. Ten women log the evenings they choose, for one) Tj
T* (month, on their own phones. We do not watch the amounts. Success) Tj
T* (is that each woman can replay her month without us in the room,) Tj
T* (and can tell us whether the cash matched the card.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (After that. Keep it only if those ten ask to continue. The next) Tj
T* (step is Marathi read-back in the worker's own words, still on) Tj
T* (device, still without an employer account.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (What we will not do in the launch) Tj
T* (- Tell her the record will win a case.) Tj
T* (- Ask her to play it in the employer's kitchen.) Tj
T* (- Add payments, UPI, or a helpline integration.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Build boundary for this round) Tj
T* (Real: speech or typed sentence, read-back, confirm, month card,) Tj
T* (listen, copy.) Tj
T* (Not in this build: recovery of wages, legal filing, employer sign-off.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
